            <div class="section-header">
                <span class="section-tag">FAQ</span>
                <h2 class="section-title">Questions?<br />We've got answers.</h2>
            </div>

            <details class="faq-item" open>
                <summary class="faq-question">
                    <span>Can board members see my notes during presentations?</span>
                    <svg class="faq-icon" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                        <path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6" />
                    </svg>
                </summary>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    <p>No! CueCard is invisible during screen sharing. Your board sees your slides and data, not your talking points or sensitive notes.</p>
                </div>
            </details>
            <details class="faq-item">
                <summary class="faq-question">
                    <span>Is it secure for confidential information?</span>
                    <svg class="faq-icon" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                        <path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6" />
                    </svg>
                </summary>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    <p>CueCard runs locally on your computer. Your notes never leave your device or get uploaded anywhere.</p>
                </div>
            </details>
            <details class="faq-item">
                <summary class="faq-question">
                    <span>Can I use it for investor presentations?</span>
                    <svg class="faq-icon" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                        <path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6" />
                    </svg>
                </summary>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    <p>Absolutely! Keep your key metrics, funding details, and Q&A prep notes visible during high-stakes investor meetings.</p>
                </div>
            </details>
            <details class="faq-item">
                <summary class="faq-question">
                    <span>Is CueCard free?</span>
                    <svg class="faq-icon" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                        <path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6" />
                    </svg>
                </summary>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    <p>Yes! CueCard is completely free and open source under the MIT License.</p>
                </div>
            </details>

            {% include "partials/faq-cta.njk" %}
